==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Deathkory]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Fallen Bear]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Take a ranged [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] to prevent Deathkory from ruining the battle, [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] to handle the [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] to hit from a distance, and at least 2 Meatshields. From there, you can either prioritize [[Cat Combo|Combos]] or bring [[:Category:Anti-Aku Cats|Anti-Aku Cats]].

==Trivia==
*Fishcake Fortress's Japanese name, Narū-tō (ナルー塔, "Naru Tower"), refers to ''[[wikipedia:Narutomaki|narutomaki]]'', a common ramen topping consisting of ''[[wikipedia:Surimi|surimi]]'' with a pink spiral pattern. It may also reference [[wikipedia:ja:鳴門わかめ|Naruto wakame]] (edible [[wikipedia:Wakame|wakame]] harvested from around [[wikipedia:Naruto, Tokushima|Naruto, Tokushima]]) or the manga ''[[wikipedia:Naruto|Naruto]]'', whose eponymous [[wikia:naruto:Naruto Uzumaki|protagonist]] loves to eat ramen.

